{"ticker":{"symbol":"084690.KS","name":"대상홀딩스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":7430.0,"change_pct":0.022008253094910613,"market_cap":275846332416.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.040376850605652756,"week52_low":6470.0,"week52_high":11060.0,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":56,"website":"https://www.daesang.co.kr","business_summary":"Daesang Holdings Co., Ltd. engages in the general food business in South Korea, Asia, the United States, Europe, Oceania, and Africa. It offers traditional bean pastes, such as Soonchang, Hatsal Dameun, etc.; seasonings, such as MIWON, Gamchimi, Matsunsaeng, etc.; agro fishery food products, including vinegar and fish sauces; fresh food comprising Kimchi and tofu; western food products; deli; and frozen foods. The company also produces starches and sweeteners; flavor enhancers, amino acids, and microalgae based ingredients; phenylalanine, glutamine, glutamic acid, arginine, histidine, phenylalanine, lysine, etc.; and researches and develops food processing technologies. Daesang Holdings Co., Ltd. was founded in 1956 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"대상홀딩스(주)는 한국, 아시아, 미국, 유럽, 오세아니아, 아프리카에서 종합식품사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 순창, 핫살담은 등 전통 된장을 판매하고 있습니다. 미원(MIWON), 감치미, 마순생 등의 조미료; 식초, 액젓 등의 농수산물; 김치와 두부를 포함하는 신선식품; 서양식품; 총알; 그리고 냉동식품. 이 회사는 또한 전분과 감미료도 생산합니다. 향미 강화제, 아미노산, 미세조류 기반 성분; 페닐알라닌, 글루타민, 글루탐산, 아르기닌, 히스티딘, 페닐알라닌, 리신 등; 식품가공 기술을 연구, 개발하고 있습니다. 대상홀딩스(주)는 1956년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"가공식품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":5226659820070.0,"operating_income":146857242360.0,"net_income":32222647740.0,"eps":868.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":5259400430140.0,"operating_income":114614891730.0,"net_income":